<p>You and your Worm that Walks both teleport to an enemy in range 10 and make a melee attack for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">96%, 107%, 116%, 123%, 130%</acronym> damage.</p><p>Your Worm that Walks' Blindside talent cooldown is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 2, 2, 3.</acronym></p>